We need shift_candidate_beta to be prepared first. So we need to prepare shift_candidate_beta.

Preparing a candidate: confirm_candidate_preparedness ?candidate - candidate_entity ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile. Precondition: candidate_created ?candidate, vehicle_allocated ?candidate, candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile, not candidate_prepared ?candidate. Effect: candidate_prepared ?candidate.

